            <p>The Female Reproductive&#x000a0;System. In females, pelvic organs include the reproductive organs (the uterus, paired fallopian tubes, and ovaries) and other organs, such as the bladder and rectum, surrounded by ligaments, nerves, lymph nodes, and vasculature. Blausen.com staff. Medical Gallery of Blausen Medical 2014. <italic toggle="yes">WikiJournal of Medicine.</italic> doi: 10.15347/wjm/2014.010.ISSN 2002-4436. [CC BY 3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0)] via Wikimedia Commons.</p>
